  The block-sparse attention algorithm implemented here -- 128-token block
  mean pooling, the q-bar/k-c pilot score, the mean + tau*std routing
  threshold, and the approximate correction that folds below-threshold blocks
  back in via their proxy scores -- originates from Sol-Attn:

    Sol-Attn: Accelerating Video Generation Inference via On-the-Fly
    Attention Sparsification
    arXiv:2607.24027

